---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="LiveChat — Live chat that gets out of the way"
  description="One script tag. A realtime inbox. Separate, secure data for every customer. Add live chat to your site in minutes."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <a class="pill" href="/pricing">New: per-workspace isolation and audit logs <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    <h1>Live chat that gets out of the way.</h1>
    <p class="sub">
      One script tag. A realtime inbox. Separate, secure data for every customer.
    </p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/signup">Start for free</a>
      <a class="btn-outline" href="/demo">Live demo</a>
    </div>
    <pre class="snippet"><code>&lt;script src="https://cdn.example.com/widget.js" data-public-key="pk_..." async&gt;&lt;/script&gt;<span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true">&#9608;</span></code></pre>
  </section>

  <section class="preview" aria-label="Product preview">
    <div class="preview-app">
      <div class="preview-side">
        <span class="preview-side-item active"></span>
        <span class="preview-side-item"></span>
        <span class="preview-side-item"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="preview-thread">
        <div class="preview-bubble in d1">Hi — do you ship to Canada?</div>
        <div class="preview-bubble out d2">Yes! Orders before 3pm ship same day.</div>
        <div class="preview-bubble in d3">Perfect, ordering now.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <article class="card">
      <h3>Realtime inbox</h3>
      <p>Messages land instantly over WebSockets. Reply from a dark, fast, keyboard-friendly inbox.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h3>Workspace isolation</h3>      <p>Every customer gets their own workspace with row-level security. No shared tables, ever.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h3>Secure by default</h3>
      <p>2FA, roles, invites, API keys, and a full audit log — included on every plan.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="final-cta">
    <h2>Add chat to your site today.</h2>
    <a class="btn-primary" href="/signup">Create free account</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: var(--max-hero);
    margin: 96px auto 0;
    text-align: center;
    animation: fade-up 0.9s var(--ease) both;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -120px;
    left: 50%;
    width: 600px;
    height: 420px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(110, 106, 240, 0.35), transparent);
    filter: blur(20px);
    animation: glow-drift 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: -1;
  }
  .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--accent-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s var(--ease);
  }
  .pill:hover { border-color: var(--border-hover); }
  h1 {
    font-size: 68px;
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
  }
  .sub {
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 20px auto 0;
  }
  .ctas { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 32px; }
  .snippet {
    margin: 48px auto 0;
    max-width: 640px;
    text-align: left;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .cursor { color: var(--accent); animation: cursor-blink 1s steps(1) infinite; }

  .preview { max-width: 880px; margin: 72px auto 0; }
  .preview-app {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 300px;
  }
  .preview-side { border-right: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 16px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .preview-side-item { height: 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface-2); }
  .preview-side-item.active { background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .preview-thread { padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .preview-bubble {
    max-width: 60%;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    animation: fade-up 0.9s var(--ease) both;
  }
  .preview-bubble.in { align-self: flex-start; background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; }
  .preview-bubble.out { align-self: flex-end; background: var(--text); color: var(--bg); border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; }
  .d1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
  .d2 { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
  .d3 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 96px;
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 24px;
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--ease), border-color 0.2s var(--ease);
    animation: fade-up 0.9s var(--ease) both;
  }
  .card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
  .card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.13s; }
  .card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.21s; }
  .card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--border-hover); }
  .card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; }
  .card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }

  .final-cta {
    margin-top: 96px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 64px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .final-cta h2 { font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 24px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    h1 { font-size: 44px; }
    .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .final-cta h2 { font-size: 28px; }
  }
</style>